# 换行符策略：源码统一 LF；Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
# （曾经因为 一键重新打包apk.bat 是 LF，双击直接报 "The system cannot find the path specified"，
#   所以这里显式钉死，免得被编辑器或 git 自动转换搞坏。）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf

# 二进制文件不做任何转换
*.png      binary
*.jpg      binary
*.jpeg     binary
*.gif      binary
*.ico      binary
*.jar      binary
*.apk      binary
*.xlsx     binary
*.jks      binary
*.keystore binary
*.dex      binary
